# GhostChain L1 env overrides for MAINNET releases.
#
# Non-secret only. Do NOT put private keys, mnemonics, or JWT secrets here.
#
# Examples (uncomment and set on the mainnet VM / sealed release as needed):
# L1_RPC_REQUIRE_AUTH=1
# L1_RPC_AUTH_TOKEN=change-me
# L1_RPC_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=60
# L1_RPC_RATE_LIMIT_BURST=20

